    'Mesečni paket od 8 feniranja - idealno za žene koje feniraju 2-3 puta nedeljno. Frizerski salon na Novom Beogradu, blizu West65 mall-a.' => 'A monthly package of 8 blowouts - ideal for women who blowout 2-3 times a week. Hair salon in New Belgrade, near the West65 mall.',
