    'Da. Dry65 je walk-in salon za feniranje, samo dođete, bez termina. Ova stranica pokazuje trenutnu gužvu da odaberete pravo vreme za dolazak.' => 'Yes. Dry65 is a walk-in blowout salon, you just come in, no appointment. This page shows how busy we are so you can pick the right time to arrive.',
    'Zavisi od gužve, od bez čekanja kada smo slobodni do preko 45 minuta u špicu. Trenutnu procenu vidite na vrhu ove strane, uživo.' => 'It depends on how busy we are, from no wait when we are free to over 45 minutes at peak times. You can see the current estimate at the top of this page, live.',
    'Otvorite ovu stranicu (dry65.com/live) pre polaska. Status se ažurira uživo, pa vidite gužvu i procenu čekanja u realnom vremenu.' => 'Open this page (dry65.com/live) before you leave. The status updates live, so you can see how busy we are and the estimated wait in real time.',
    'Najmirnije je obično radnim danima između 13h i 16h, pa ako Vam raspored dozvoljava, to je idealno vreme za opušteno feniranje uz najkraće čekanje. Pošto se gužva menja iz dana u dan, najsigurnije je da uživo proverite status na ovoj strani pre nego što krenete.' => 'It is usually calmest on weekdays between 1pm and 4pm, so if your schedule allows, that is the ideal time for a relaxed blowout with the shortest wait. Since it changes from day to day, the safest bet is to check the live status on this page before you set off.',
    'Ne, Dry65 je walk-in salon. Samo dođete kad Vam odgovara, bez zakazivanja i bez pritiska. Nalazimo se u lameli Ž kompleksa West 65 na Novom Beogradu, blizu West 65 mall-a.' => 'No, Dry65 is a walk-in salon. Just come whenever suits you, no appointments and no pressure. We are in building Ž of the West 65 complex in New Belgrade, near the West 65 mall.',
    'Radimo od ponedeljka do petka 8:00 do 20:00, subotom 10:00 do 18:00. Nedeljom ne radimo.' => 'We are open Monday to Friday 8:00 to 20:00, Saturday 10:00 to 18:00. Closed on Sunday.',
    'Standardno feniranje traje 30 do 45 minuta, u zavisnosti od dužine i gustine kose. Extra duga i gusta kosa može trajati do sat vremena.' => 'A standard blowout takes 30 to 45 minutes, depending on hair length and thickness. Extra long and thick hair can take up to an hour.',
    'Radimo feniranje na talase, lokne, ravno, volumen, na četke i afro curls. Pored toga, imamo Hair Mask i Hair Infusion tretmane za dubinsku negu kose.' => 'We do blowouts into waves, curls, sleek, volume, round-brush and afro curls. We also offer Hair Mask and Hair Infusion treatments for deep hair care.',
    'Ne. Dry65 je specijalizovan isključivo za feniranje, stilizovanje i negu kose. Radimo jednu stvar, feniramo, i u tome smo najbolji.' => 'No. Dry65 specializes exclusively in blowouts, styling and hair care. We do one thing, blowouts, and we do it best.',
    'Isključivo Schwarzkopf Professional preparate, vodeći svetski brend za profesionalnu salonsku negu kose.' => 'Exclusively Schwarzkopf Professional products, the world’s leading brand for professional salon hair care.',
    'Hair Mask je dubinski tretman nege kose koji se radi uz feniranje. Dostupan u tri nivoa (Basic, Medium, Premium), sa opcijom parne stanice za dodatan efekat.' => 'Hair Mask is a deep hair care treatment done together with a blowout. Available in three levels (Basic, Medium, Premium), with an optional steam station for extra effect.',
    'Cene feniranja: kratka kosa 1.400 din, srednja 1.800 din, duga 2.000 din, extra duga 2.200 din. Detaljan cenovnik svih usluga dostupan je na stranici Cenovnik.' => 'Blowout prices: short hair 1,400 RSD, medium 1,800 RSD, long 2,000 RSD, extra long 2,200 RSD. The full price list for all services is on the Pricing page.',
    'Da. Imamo mesečne pakete od 4, 8 ili 12 feniranja mesečno, sa značajnom uštedom po feniranju. Uz svaki paket dobijate na poklon masažu glave i profesionalni tretman nege kose.' => 'Yes. We have monthly packages of 4, 8 or 12 blowouts per month, with significant savings per blowout. Every package includes a complimentary scalp massage and a professional hair care treatment.',
    'Ne, mesečni paket je personalizovan. Ali odličan je za istu klijentkinju kojoj se sviđa da fenira više puta mesečno.' => 'No, the monthly package is personal. But it is great for one client who likes to blowout several times a month.',
    'Neiskorišćeni termini se ne prenose u sledeći mesec. Preporučujemo paket koji odgovara Vašoj realnoj frekvenciji, na primer 4 termina mesečno je odličan za nedeljno feniranje.' => 'Unused sessions do not carry over to the next month. We recommend a package that matches how often you really come, for example 4 sessions a month is great for a weekly blowout.',
    'Da, uz svaki mesečni paket dobijate na poklon masažu glave i profesionalni tretman nege kose (Hair Mask ili Hair Infusion).' => 'Yes, every monthly package includes a complimentary scalp massage and a professional hair care treatment (Hair Mask or Hair Infusion).',
    'Omladinskih Brigada 86Ž, lamela Ž, Novi Beograd, blizu West 65 mall-a i Airport City poslovne zone.' => 'Omladinskih Brigada 86Ž, building Ž, New Belgrade, near the West 65 mall and the Airport City business zone.',
    'Da. U kompleksu West 65 prvi sat parkiranja je besplatan.' => 'Yes. In the West 65 complex, the first hour of parking is free.',
    'Kvalitetno feniranje sa Schwarzkopf Professional preparatima drži 3 do 5 dana, u zavisnosti od tipa kose. Za produženo trajanje preporučujemo svilenu jastučnicu.' => 'A quality blowout with Schwarzkopf Professional products lasts 3 to 5 days, depending on your hair type. For longer wear we recommend a silk pillowcase.',
    'Prihvatamo obе opcije: gotovinu i sve kartice (Visa, Mastercard, Maestro, Dinacard).' => 'We accept both: cash and all cards (Visa, Mastercard, Maestro, Dinacard).',
    'Da. Poklon vaučer za feniranje ili mesečni paket je odličan poklon za prijateljicu, majku ili sestru. Za detalje pozovite +381 60 6900655 ili pišite na Instagram @dry65belgrade.' => 'Yes. A gift voucher for a blowout or a monthly package is a great gift for a friend, mother or sister. For details call +381 60 6900655 or message us on Instagram @dry65belgrade.',
    'Prosek čekanja je 5 do 15 minuta. Za trenutan status pozovite +381 60 6900655 pre dolaska.' => 'The average wait is 5 to 15 minutes. For the current status call +381 60 6900655 before you come.',

