    /* ---- Ambijent / Kontakt (lokacija, dodatni tekst) ---- */
    'Google Maps-a' => 'Google Maps',
    'uživo' => 'live status',
    'Prostor je osmišljen oko jedne jednostavne ideje – feniranje treba da bude brzo, prijatno i bez nepotrebnog čekanja. Radne stanice su raspoređene tako da svaka klijentkinja ima dovoljno prostora za sebe, dok je zona za pranje odvojena od dela za feniranje.' => 'The space is built around one simple idea, a blowout should be quick, pleasant and free of unnecessary waiting. Workstations are arranged so every client has enough room to herself, while the wash area is separate from the blowout area.',
    'Svetlo je toplo i prirodno kad god je to moguće, a drvo, lan i zemljane nijanse daju prostoru mirniji i prijatniji osećaj, bez klasičnog, hladnog salonskog utiska.' => 'Light is warm and natural whenever possible, and wood, linen and earthy tones give the space a calmer, friendlier feel, without the usual cold salon look.',
    'Nalazimo se u stambenom kompleksu West 65 na Novom Beogradu, na spoljnoj ivici kompleksa, u lokalu u lameli Ž. Lokaciju je najlakše pronaći preko %s, gde nas možeš precizno locirati i dobiti uputstva za dolazak.' => 'We are located in the West 65 residential complex in New Belgrade, on the outer edge of the complex, in a unit in building Ž. The easiest way to find us is through %s, where you can pinpoint our exact location and get directions.',
    'Pošto radimo bez zakazivanja, u salonu je uvek živahno i nešto se dešava, ali smo prostor uredili tako da svaka klijentkinja može da se opusti i uživa u svom vremenu dok traje feniranje. Ambijent redovno osvežavamo, a najnovije fotografije i dešavanja iz salona možeš pratiti na Instagramu.' => 'Since we work without appointments, the salon always feels lively and something is happening, but we have set up the space so every client can relax and enjoy her own time during the blowout. We refresh the space regularly, and you can follow the latest photos and updates from the salon on Instagram.',
    'Dry65 se nalazi na Novom Beogradu, u stambenom kompleksu West 65, na njegovoj spoljnoj ivici, u lokalu u lameli Ž. Salon je u blizini Airport City poslovne zone, a do nas se lako stiže i sa Bulevara Zorana Đinđića i Aerodromske ulice.' => 'Dry65 is located in New Belgrade, in the West 65 residential complex, on its outer edge, in a unit in building Ž. The salon is near the Airport City business zone, and it is easy to reach from both Zoran Đinđić Boulevard and Aerodromska Street.',
    'Pošto se salon nalazi na spoljnom delu kompleksa, a ne unutar samog West 65 mall-a, najlakše je da lokaciju i tačnu poziciju salona pronađeš preko %s. Tamo možeš dobiti i najpreciznija uputstva za dolazak.' => 'Since the salon is on the outer part of the complex, not inside the West 65 mall itself, the easiest way to find the exact location is through %s. There you can also get the most precise directions.',
    'Radimo isključivo bez zakazivanja, pa ako imaš pitanje pre dolaska, možeš nas kontaktirati telefonom, mejlom ili putem Instagram poruke. Za informaciju o trenutnoj gužvi možeš pogledati našu stranicu %1$s pre nego što kreneš. Za pitanja o poslu i otvorenim pozicijama pogledaj stranicu %2$s.' => 'We work exclusively without appointments, so if you have a question before coming, you can reach us by phone, email or Instagram message. For current wait times, check our %1$s page before you set off. For questions about jobs and open positions, see the %2$s page.',
    'Feniranje je osnova svega što radimo. Možeš da biraš između različitih stilova, ravno, na talase, na lokne ili sa više volumena, u zavisnosti od toga kako želiš da ti kosa izgleda tog dana.' => 'Blowouts are the foundation of everything we do. You can choose between different styles, sleek, wavy, curly or with more volume, depending on how you want your hair to look that day.',
    'Pored feniranja, nudimo i tretmane nege kose. Želimo da brinemo o zdravlju tvoje kose, a tretmani su odlična dopuna feniranju i pomažu da kosa ostane negovana i duže zadrži oblik i stil.' => 'Besides blowouts, we also offer hair care treatments. We want to take care of your hair\'s health, and the treatments are a great complement to a blowout, helping hair stay nourished and hold its shape and style longer.',
    'Stilizovanje peglom i figarom takođe je deo naših usluga. Ako želiš da tvoja frizura bude još upečatljivija, stilizovanje toplim uređajima daje kosi izražajniji karakter, dodatnu definiciju i dugotrajniji efekat. Odlično je rešenje za proslave, posebne prilike i važne datume, ali i kada jednostavno želiš da izgledaš posebno tog dana. Stilizovanje može doprineti da frizura duže zadrži svoj oblik, čak i kod kose koja je tanja ili zahtevnija za oblikovanje.' => 'Styling with a flat iron or curling wand is also part of our services. If you want your hairstyle to stand out even more, heat styling gives hair a more expressive character, extra definition and a longer-lasting effect. It is a great choice for celebrations, special occasions and important dates, but also for when you simply want to look special that day. Styling can also help a hairstyle hold its shape longer, even with hair that is thinner or harder to work with.',
    'Sve aktuelne cene i trajanje tretmana možeš pogledati na stranici %s. Ako nisi sigurna šta bi najbolje odgovaralo tvojoj kosi, slobodno pitaj naš tim u salonu, pomoći ćemo ti da izabereš ono što ti najviše odgovara. Za feniranje nije potrebno zakazivanje.' => 'You can check all current prices and treatment times on the %s page. If you are not sure what would work best for your hair, feel free to ask our team at the salon, we will help you pick what suits you best. No appointment is needed for a blowout.',

    /* ---- Schema description (SEO) + FAQ uvod ---- */
    'Frizerski salon specijalizovan za feniranje, na Novom Beogradu blizu West65 mall-a. Walk-in blowout hair bar, bez zakazivanja - samo dođeš. Cene od 1.400 din. Otvoreni Pon-Pet 8-20h, Sub 10-18h.' => 'Hair salon specialized in blowouts, in New Belgrade near the West65 mall. A walk-in blowout hair bar, no appointments, just drop by. Prices from 1,400 RSD. Open Mon-Fri 8am-8pm, Sat 10am-6pm.',
